msgid "admin_welcome"
msgstr "Welcome, {name}! You are logged in as an administrator."

msgid "main_menu_text"
msgstr ""
"Hello, <b>{name}</b>!\n\n"
"You are greeted by the intelligent chatbot <b>Franchesco AI</b> — a software module "
"designed to provide informational support to users in the field of information technology.\n\n"
"<b>Main system capabilities:</b>\n"
"• processing text queries in natural language;\n"
"• searching for relevant information in the knowledge base;\n"
"• generating meaningful and structured responses;\n"
"• interactive real-time communication with the user.\n\n"
"To get started, please select the appropriate section from the menu below."

msgid "start_ai"
msgstr "🤖 Start AI dialogue"

msgid "faq"
msgstr "⁉️ FAQ (Frequently Asked Questions)"

msgid "settings"
msgstr "⚙️ Settings"

msgid "back_main"
msgstr "🏠 Back to main menu"

msgid "enter_request"
msgstr ""
"🤖 <b>AI dialogue mode activated</b>\n\n"
"Enter your request in text form.\n\n"
"<b>Recommendations for receiving a high-quality answer:</b>\n"
"• formulate your question as clearly as possible;\n"
"• specify the technology or context (for example: Python, SQL, API);\n"
"• avoid overly general formulations.\n\n"
"After entering your request, the system will analyze it and provide a response as quickly as possible."

msgid "faq_text"
msgstr ""
"Hello, {name}!\n\n"
"I am an intelligent chatbot <b>Franchesco AI</b>, created based on modern artificial intelligence models. "
"I implement functions of intelligent user support for analyzing requests, generating meaningful answers, and "
"providing practical advice in the field of information technology. "
"My capabilities include programming, working with databases, infrastructure solutions, "
"cloud technologies, and other relevant IT areas.\n\n"
"The <b>FAQ (Frequently Asked Questions)</b> section contains reference information about "
"the capabilities and principles of operation of the <b>Franchesco AI</b> chatbot.\n\n"
"This software module implements natural language processing (NLP) mechanisms, "
"which allow interpreting user queries and finding the most relevant answers "
"in the formed knowledge base.\n\n"
"Select one of the sections below to learn more about the system functionality."

msgid "faq_examples"
msgstr "🧠 Bot capabilities"

msgid "faq_usage"
msgstr "💬 How to use the bot"

msgid "faq_examples_text"
msgstr ""
"📌 <b>System functional capabilities</b>\n\n"
"The <b>Franchesco AI</b> chatbot supports processing a wide range of queries in the field of information technology.\n\n"
"<b>Examples of queries:</b>\n"
"• Explain the principles of asynchronous programming in Python;\n"
"• Provide a definition and examples of SQL indexes;\n"
"• Describe the difference between containerization (Docker) and virtualization (VM);\n"
"• Explain the architecture of REST API.\n\n"
"The system is focused on providing clear, structured, and understandable answers."

msgid "faq_usage_text"
msgstr ""
"💬 <b>User guide</b>\n\n"
"For effective interaction with the chatbot, it is recommended to follow this algorithm:\n\n"
"1️⃣ Select “Start AI dialogue” in the main menu;\n"
"2️⃣ Enter your request;\n"
"3️⃣ Receive a response generated based on the knowledge base;\n"
"4️⃣ clarify or reformulate the request.\n\n"
"<b>Note:</b>\n"
"The quality of the response directly depends on how accurately the query is formulated."

msgid "back"
msgstr "↩️ Back to previous menu"

msgid "settings_text"
msgstr ""
"⚙️ <b>System settings menu</b>\n\n"
"In this section, the user can personalize the chatbot’s operating parameters.\n\n"
"<b>Available functions:</b>\n\n"
"👤 <b>My profile</b>\n"
"View account information, including registration date, role, and selected system language.\n\n"
"🌎 <b>Change interface language</b>\n"
"Allows selecting the language of interaction with the system.\n\n"
"🏠 <b>Back to main menu</b>\n"
"Return to the main system interface.\n\n"
"Settings are saved automatically and applied to all subsequent sessions."

msgid "profile_text"
msgstr ""
"👤 <b>User information</b>\n\n"
"This section displays the main account parameters:\n\n"
"🆔 <b>User ID:</b> {id}\n"
"📆 <b>Registration date:</b> {date}\n"
"🔐 <b>System role:</b> {role}\n"
"🤖 <b>AI model in use:</b> {model}\n"
"🌎 <b>Interface language:</b> {language}\n\n"
"This information is used to personalize the system."

